          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/fireside-work-from-home.png",
            "title": "CONVERT WOOD FIREPLACE TO GAS",
            "text": "<p>Warmth and comfort are available with just the touch of a button. Convert your wood-burning fireplace to gas and start experiencing greater performance, safety, and convenience. </p><p>Fully installed projects starting around $4,800.</p>",
